    <string name="user_api_key_required_hint">No map API keys are bundled. Apply for your own key on each map platform and enter it here. The package name and SHA1 needed for the application are on the Environment &amp; Signature page. Auto mode uses AMap, or Baidu Map when no AMap key is set; map display, search and route planning all use the same provider. Google route planning needs the Routes API enabled for the key.</string>
